  <data name="ReportMethod" xml:space="preserve"><value>Current state of work orders created in the selected UTC range. Open includes completed work awaiting closure. MTTR is elapsed time from first start to latest completion, including holds and reopens; invalid times are excluded. Costs are rounded per entry, separated by currency, and exclude voided or unissued parts. Unknown costs and legacy labor currency remain unknown; no exchange rates are assumed.</value></data>
  <data name="HistoryMethod" xml:space="preserve"><value>All-time service history unless dates are selected. Each CSV row represents one order and currency. Known costs exclude voided or unissued parts; missing prices and legacy labor currency are reported as unknown.</value></data>
  <data name="WorkOrderPacketMethod" xml:space="preserve"><value>Work-order state at the call time, with immutable revision references in the manifest. Older open maintenance is included; completed work uses the lookback window. Unrecoverable historical state is marked unavailable.</value></data>

